# Atlas Core - Refactored Component Token Specification
**Author:** Vex Okafor  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 01:40  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Standardized, DRY component-level design token dictionary for project Atlas Core, eliminating redundancy across SaaS web layouts and Face-to-Face service terminals in strict alignment with Business Document: Company Document.

